{
  "osd_version": "1.0",
  "definition": {
    "scale_info": {
      "name": "Proactive Coping Inventory",
      "code": "PCI",
      "abbreviation": "PCI",
      "description": "Multidimensional coping inventory (Greenglass, Schwarzer & Taubert, 1999). LANGUAGE VARIANT: the English version has 55 items / 7 subscales (Proactive, Reflective, Strategic Planning, Preventive, Instrumental Support Seeking, Emotional Support Seeking, Avoidance); the German 'Deutsche Testversion' has 57 items / 7 partly-different subscales (Proaktives Coping, Funktionaler Handlungsaufschub, Kognitive Bewältigung, Präventive Bewältigung, Strategische Planung, Suche nach emotionaler Unterstützung, Suche nach Unterstützung). Each language administers and scores only its own subscales. 4-point; means. See also the standalone PCOPE (Proactive Coping subscale).",
      "citation": "Greenglass, E., Schwarzer, R., & Taubert, S. (1999). The Proactive Coping Inventory (PCI). http://userpage.fu-berlin.de/~health/greenpci.htm",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "license_explanation": "Licensed to the OpenScales project under CC BY 4.0 by the author, Ralf Schwarzer (permission granted June 2026), who authorized inclusion of his scales.",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
      "url": "http://userpage.fu-berlin.de/~health/procoping.htm",
      "domain": "Personality",
      "version": "1.0"
    },
    "implementation": {
      "author": "Shane T. Mueller",
      "organization": "OpenScales Project",
      "date": "2026-06-17",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
      "notes": "LANGUAGE VARIANT with per-variant subscales (variant_when on items + `variants` tag on scoring blocks; needs the runner's scoring-block variant filter). English (greenpci.htm): 55 items, 7 subscales; reverse Proactive Coping items 2,9,14. German ('PCI - Deutsche Testversion', skalen): 57 items, 7 subscales. 'Die deutsche Version weicht von der englischen Version stark ab.' VERIFY German subscale 1 (Proaktives Coping): used the 16-item full-PCI form (the 17-item standalone minus 'Mir kommt es immer darauf an, etwas zu bewirken'); reverse mapped to items 2,7,13,14 of that 16-item list — confirm against the source. 4-point; subscales scored as means. Source does not print a single total; none provided."
    },
    "likert_options": {
      "points": 4,
      "min": 1,
      "max": 4,
      "labels": [
        "r1",
        "r2",
        "r3",
        "r4"
      ],
      "question_head": "qh"
    },
